                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya kud'ani lameeso, ka jia kud'anneeso, ka ganna kud'anneeso, ka haga nu boojiani teenne, AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, hayyu Misiri isaafi lafa isaale abaari waan jettuuni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Anini nyaapa kanketi, ee hayyu Misiri, atini nyaacha gudda bisaani keesati galu. Atini galaani nile kiyya, nati mid'aase jetta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anini hooko sibiila laagati si d'ae qurt'umini galaana keeti ch'ufti siti mamat'ante si ch'ininti. Duuba galaana suni keesaa hirkise sibaase, ka qurt'umini taani ch'ufti siti ch'iiftu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siifi qurt'umi taanile ch'ufa lafa goddu bisaani inqamneti d'abba. Ammalle atini akanumati, ka nami tokoleeni si inawaalle, diidumati hafte, anini goblola kanke allaatiifi bineensa ala nyaachisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.36.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 36.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akanaani nami lafa Misiri keesa tau ch'ufti aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Worri Israeli qarqaarsa si d'aabate, ammo atini laafa ilaadule ingeetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri siti hirkannaani atini ch'ach'abt'e bobaa worraa woraante, dudda worra kute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba amma tana anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, waan sini jed'u, Anini nama goraadeeni si ijeesu sitini d'ufe, worri namafi saa kankele fit'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misiriini badde ona taati; duuba akasiini aka anini AABBO Waaqa beetani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan atini, galaani nile kiyya anati mid'aase jetteefi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini nyaapa keetifi ka galaana keeti. Anini lafa Misiri ch'ufa haguma dira Migdoli ka mirgaati iti keeyad'e, dira Aswani ka bita, seera Kushi jiruti d'aabe balleese, ona tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga ganna afurtama faana namaatiifi ta bineensa tokole keesati inargani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa Misiri badi taka lafa d'ibi keesati inargini itiini d'ufe, haga ganna afurtama diri isii sunini dira lafa ch'ufa ira bade ona taha. Anini nama lafa Misiri ch'ufa lafa isaani keesaa baase, worri baqate lafa d'ibi keesa taa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Eegi ganna afurtama anini worra Misiri lafa qara iti firfirse taani keesaa deebise, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lafa worraa, moga bita, fulla worri duri keesaa bahe taaniti galcha. Achiti worri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gosa gosa ch'ufa ira muyoo tae, iti deebie lafa d'ibi imohatu. Anini aka male worra laafise, duuba worri itumaa deebie gosa d'ibi irreeni imbulchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli itumaa deebie qarqaarsa worra ind'aabatu. Duuba akanaani worri Israeli aka wonti worri duri Misiri d'aabateefi kaani wollaala arge hubata. Akanaani duuba worri Israeli aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka hayyu Nebukadrezani lafa Misiri dabsatu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya qara ka jia qara, ganna diddami torbeeso, ka haga nu boojiani nu teenne, AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha hayyuuni Babiloni, ka Nebukadreza jed'ani, ya askarti fud'ate dira Tiro aka hama had'e. Inni askarti isaa waan ulfo baachise, baani sunini rifeensa mata ira luqifte gurmule urte. Ammo hayyichafi askartileeni namu waan tae suni ira woma inarganne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi amma tana wonti anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, jed'u tana: Anini lafa Misiri hayyu Nebukadrezati kenna, Inni lafa suni had'e saame, balleese, waan worri Misiri qabu ch'ufa boojie, waan suni ch'ufa askarti isati kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan isaafi askartini isaa naa hojateefi, anini lafa Misiri isaa kenna. Nami waan kana jed'e, ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo wonti kunini ch'ufti guutamte, anini gosa Israeli jabeese, si Ezekielile aka nami ch'ufti si d'agayu araba sii hiikhe si dubbachiise duuba akanaani aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekhani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka AABBO Waaqi lafa Misiri balleesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
